  "body": "## Change and scope\n\nAnswers the transfer-coupled open question left by [#2779](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2779) on the [#2715](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2715) / [#2761](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2761) lineage in the five-source common-B mutable-source alphabet of [#1898](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1898): can a shared prefix, priced transfer `C\u22651`, and divergent suffixes undercut tariff `436` at total `Q=7` after a complete dirty bill?\n\nScoped to maximal-sharing shape `(p,a,b)=(5,1,1)` (two length-6 walks, prefix counted once).\n\n| Schedule | Covering pairs | Min R | Min fair X at min R | Tariff floor | Undercuts 436? |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| Partitioned dual (#2779) | \u2014 | 112 | \u2014 | \u2265490 | no |\n| Transfer-coupled `(5,1,1)` | **8749440** | **84** | **9** | **\u2265452** | **no** |\n| Same-walk even-subset (#2686) | \u2014 | 82 | \u2014 | \u2265442 at X=6 | no |\n\nEvery covering distinct-label `(5,1,1)` dual has `R\u2208{84,88,90}`. On the `R=84` layer, fair shared-prefix XOR billing with `C=1` is at least `9`. Abstract tariff `38\u00b77+2\u00b784+2\u00b79=452>436`.\n\n**Scoped obstruction / priced alphabet; no new kappa.** Leave-alone through [#2779](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2779) was not reopened.\n\n## Result\n\nPackage: `research/transfer-coupled-7q-obstruction/`.\nTip: `adb647eba5842812b36e67fe1aa2be5ecdff6b37`.\n\nExact: min R **84**, min fair X **9**, tariff floor **452**; no undercut of 436.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -I -B research/transfer-coupled-7q-obstruction/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -O -B research/transfer-coupled-7q-obstruction/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/transfer-coupled-7q-obstruction/independent.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/transfer-coupled-7q-obstruction/test_package.py\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/transfer-coupled-7q-obstruction\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n```text\nPASS_TRANSFER_COUPLED_7Q_OBSTRUCTION covering=8749440 min_R=84 min_fair_X=9 tariff_floor=452 answers_transfer_coupled_511 no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_TRANSFER_COUPLED_7Q covering=8749440 min_R=84 min_fair_X=9 tariff_floor=452 ... answers_transfer_coupled_511 no_new_kappa\nPASS_TRANSFER_COUPLED_7Q_PACKAGE_TESTS groups=6\nPASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE research/transfer-coupled-7q-obstruction outcome=completed\n```\n\nDefault verify is read-only. Admission uses `need()`; `-O` also passes.\n\n## Overlap and credit\n\nClosest prior: [#2779](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2779) (partitioned dual), [#2761](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2761), [#2686](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2686). Freestanding transfer-coupled `(5,1,1)` fixture; no competing open PR at refresh.\n\nCredit the mutable-source / #2779 / #2761 / #2715 / PR1898 lineage. Prepared by Wentao Li ([VictorLiwentao](https://github.com/VictorLiwentao), [@Is__Victor](https://x.com/Is__Victor)) with substantial AI assistance, under Apache-2.0.",
